# Clones ≠ Laser

- One loadout skill only. Picking **Clones** means you have **no Laser** (and vice versa).
- Spawned **clone cubes** have `selectedSkill = null` — no laser waves, no skill button, no re-cloning.
- Only a player whose skill is `laser` may push `activeLaserRoutines` / call `spawnLaserLine`.
- Never imply “clone lasers” in code comments, UI, or collision rules.
